INSERT INTO featurePropertyI18n(featureId,propertyId,locale,value,valueGen) VALUES('eln2027BookDE','w7L3$qPA41ij','en','Martina Hefter is an author and performer based in Leipzig. Her texts move between poetry, scenic forms of writing, and novelistic writing. She stages many of her texts in collaboration with other artists. In Germany, she has published three novels, and five volumes of poetry. Her novel Hey, Good Morning, How Are You? won the German Book Prize in 2024, and is her first work to be translated into English.',0) ON CONFLICT(featureId,propertyId,locale) DO UPDATE SET value=excluded.value,valueGen=0 WHERE coalesce(trim(featurePropertyI18n.value),'')='';
